{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g3-lite-koko-25w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite Koko 25W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite KOKO 25W Pod System, featuring a 1200mAh battery, active resistance detection, and holds up to 2.5mL within the pod. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-g3-replacement-pods\" title=\"Caliburn G3 Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrafted from ultra-low weight materials, the Caliburn G3 Lite KOKO is a slimmed-down version, without sacrificing any performance. Eliminating any screens, the Caliburn G3 Lite KOKO preserves precious battery life for vaporizing your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUWELL CALIBURN G3 LITE KOKO 25W POD SYSTEM FEATURES:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIMENSIONS: 76mm by 49.6mm by 17.9mm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CAPACITY: 1200mAh\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CONFIGURATION: Integrated Rechargeable\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWATTAGE RANGE: 5-25W\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHASSIS MATERIAL: PC + ABS\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOPERATION: Draw-Activated\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOUTPUT: Intelligent Resistance Detection\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHARGING: USB Type-C\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CONNECTION: Magnetic\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CAPACITY: 2.5mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD MATERIAL: PCTG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFILL SYSTEM: Top Fill\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCOIL SUPPORT: ALL G3 Cartridges\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanyard Attachment Point\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n